// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P643591244" "We won't take this garbage any longer!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1967364100" "The time for revenge is NOW!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2441770935" "Vengeance is ours!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRELUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2789624090" "Who do you think you are!?"
// SHARKHEAD_PRELUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P12795759" "This is none of your business. Now make like a tree and leave!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRELUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P709064628" "Get outta our way, punk!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRELUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3845669997" "If you're not for us, you're against us. Looks like you're against us!"

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_BREAKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1422347632" "The coast is clear guys, come on out!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_BREAKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2986889059" "I don't see anyone on this side."
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_BREAKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P843916519" "It's a go, boys. Wait for my signal."
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_BREAKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P481801652" "5... 4... 3... 2... 1!"

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_BREAKOUT_LEAVEDOOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3678332413" "This is what you get for nosing around our business!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_BREAKOUT_LEAVEDOOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2904509781" "You're gonna get it now!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_BREAKOUT_LEAVEDOOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1487005910" "We're gonna bury you ALIVE."
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_BREAKOUT_LEAVEDOOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P615344411" "Say hello to the Pit, loser."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1163237129" "This looks like the place."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2087082860" "Looks like the inventory list I bought was accurate."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3692256916" "I say we break in here tomorrow night."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P692626017" "This joint is full of stuff!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P402659177" "I wonder if we can make any money sellin' this stuff on the black market."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2150253505" "WHAT THE... HEY!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2077550943" "See this pickaxe? No? Then lemme give you a third eye-hole!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1734275915" "Don't let them get away!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2160835206" "Not this time!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3320479845" "You're taking too long. What if someone sees us?"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1064479006" "Hurry up!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2796427675" "You're takin' your sweet time."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1828821917" "The coast is still clear, but hurry up."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1939026851" "If you don't hurry we'll end up in one of Recluse's prisons."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P8445517" "Hurry. You remember what Arachnos' prison is like, right? Where you look forward to the electric shock therapy because everything else is worse?"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1703079365" "I told you guys this would happen!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2414939702" "Don't just stand there, get 'em!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2228025255" "Get your nose outta our business!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P869211049" "It looks like we'll need to make a few adjustments here or there, but we're in good shape."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3701825939" "Nice job.  Keep it up."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P860218563" "Yeah, we're fixing that as we speak."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P721808861" "Get 'em, boys!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1804710799" "This is the last time this happens!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1223702340" "Feed 'em to the sharks!"

// SHARKHEAD_CRATE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4117730508" "Good work, men.  We're on time."
// SHARKHEAD_CRATE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P560729802" "We got it under control!"
// SHARKHEAD_CRATE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3236126619" "Move those crates to the left."
// SHARKHEAD_CRATE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3395580393" "Stack that shipment over on the right."
// SHARKHEAD_CRATE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2121382594" "Keep up the good work, we've gotta get this shipment to the boats!"
// SHARKHEAD_CRATE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2489973524" "Did something just move in that box?"

// SHARKHEAD_CRATE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1267239830" "I don't know how we get anything done with these interruptions"
// SHARKHEAD_CRATE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3454940190" "Get 'em, boys. We ain't got time for this."
// SHARKHEAD_CRATE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P152109382" "Grab the dynamite, we'll put it to good use here!"

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_HANDOUTS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1694394101" "Why doesn't anyone care about what's going on here?"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_HANDOUTS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3285661500" "Are you people gonna take this kind of treatment! I say no!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_HANDOUTS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2035636232" "Down with the Consortium!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_HANDOUTS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P228692041" "Take one. And read it."
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_HANDOUTS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4226510931" "Cage kills!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_HANDOUTS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P599216303" "The Cage Consortium is evil!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_HANDOUTS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P432581725" "Cage's fortune was built on the blood of the people."

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_HANDOUTS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P110667688" "Excuse me, HEY!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_HANDOUTS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P654500124" "PUNK!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_HANDOUTS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4264861130" "Wha.. What the heck are you doin'?"

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PROTEST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P236384631" "Freedom for miners!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PROTEST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P776987722" "We want safer conditions!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PROTEST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1745171686" "Abolish slavery!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PROTEST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4254298119" "Down with Cage Consortium!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PROTEST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4027138443" "Equal work for equal pay!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PROTEST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P996297037" "31 accidents a day is too high!"

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PROTEST_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2526631145" "Scrapyard will not stand for this!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PROTEST_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P382734003" "Why us? What did we do to you!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PROTEST_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4036583977" "Leave us alone, we're not bothering anyone!"

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1213898101" "Remember. Six o'clock. Big boom."
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P202164212" "Replace some of the shipment with rocks. No one'll know 'til they unpack it, and that could be months."
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3081786470" "Weigh the crates down. We can make a little extra cash with this stuff on the black market."
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3260695040" "I dunno what's so important about this stuff."

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PLOTMASTERMIND_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2282245030" "Who do you think you are?!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_PLOTMASTERMIND_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2153501103" "We'll bury you in an unmarked grave!"

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1761468957" "Keep the guys workin'."
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2337124599" "We need to make certain those shipments get sent in on time."
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2454960402" "Make certain  there's enough dynamite for tomorrow's blast."
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3703441711" "Those shipments need to get to the warehouses at the port."

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1704751890" "You're not going to jeopardize our work!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P372404184" "You're not supposed to be here!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2613245593" "We'll bury you alive, jerk."
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAPYARD_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2689673481" "Crematorium? We got the Hell Forge!"

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_TURF_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3500554070" "Ya, we're here, you got that corner covered?"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_TURF_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3280777023" "When the boys are off duty send them this way!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_TURF_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3517651866" "How are things over there?"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_TURF_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1559722396" "I heard we made the newspaper!"

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_TURF_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P28515688" "Send in the boys!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_TURF_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2163494100" "Don't think you'll get away with this!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_TURF_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P941821532" "We'll bury you in the Pit!"

// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1926361359" "Are we at the work site yet?"
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4172324701" "How much farther is today's work site?"
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P168157204" "Get it done and we get to work at Port Oakes next."
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3234236773" "Let's keep moving, there's work to do."
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P513582363" "Keep up, slow-pokes!"

// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1805422299" "Back off buddy, or you'll be at the bottom of the Pit!"
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1343159690" "You're about to wind up in Potter's Field, jerk. And I'll make sure there ain't so much as a piece of rebar to mark your grave."
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4288804137" "Ah crud. This never goes well."

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_WORSHIP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3413875776" "Oh, Scrapyard, if only you were here for us now."
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_WORSHIP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3770223740" "When will you show yourself again, Scrapyard?  We need you."
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_WORSHIP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1814948605" "Come to us.  Help us, Scrapyard!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_WORSHIP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4085407028" "Rescue us, Scrapyard!"

// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_WORSHIP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2528942746" "How dare you interrupt!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_WORSHIP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1692761707" "Scrapyard will have vengeance!"
// SHARKHEAD_SCRAP_WORSHIP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1108035538" "This land is sacred.  Get OUT!"


