// SHARKHEAD_CHASINGWOUNDED_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P445281689" "Sure you're wounded, but I'll chase you anyway.  It's not sporting, but I'm all about the easy mark."
// SHARKHEAD_CHASINGWOUNDED_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3593988149" "You know you're leaving a blood trail, right?"

// SHARKHEAD_CHASINGWOUNDED_CHASER_ALERT_TEXT :
