// SHARKHEAD_CHASINGWOUNDED_CHASER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4283705345" "Ah, more to the party!"

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_WELDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1054850974" "Time to put the tools to use."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_WELDER_ALERT_TEXT :
